  "name": "Evasion",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level, your keen instincts lets you dodge out of the way of certain area effects, such as a red dragon's fiery breath or an ice storm spell. When you are subjected to an an effect that allows you to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, you instead take no damage if you succeed on the save, and only half damage if you fail.</p>",
